> The eagerly anticipated Out[ NYC Urban] Resort opened its doors to guests on March 1, 2012.
This straight-friendly urban resort is poised to become a travel and[ entertainment destination] for New[ Yorkers] and visitors alike. The complex, situated on 42nd Street between 10th and 11th[ Aven]ues, encompasses a 105-room[ boutique] hotel, the 14,000 square foot XL Nightclub, Cabaret & Lounge by John Blair, Beto Sutter, and FV[ Events], a late-[night restaurant] called Kitchin, three courtyards, a business/conference center, function space, and a[ wellness] center.
